lor:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>第一行：主通风机 2 台&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>第二行：皮带输送机 1 套&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>第三行：供电柜 4 面&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>"
